      {
        "item": "bookings.member_uid",
        "explanation": "The Firebase user id was converted to a uuid column named member_id using uuid5, so row-level security can compare it to auth.uid(). This only works if the Supabase auth users use the same uuid5 values, so confirm that mapping before enabling policies."
      },
      {
        "item": "bookings.starts_at",
