      },
      {
        "item": "clubs.owner_uid",
        "explanation": "Converted to owner_id (uuid5 of the Firebase uid) for the same reason as member_id. The same auth-id mapping check applies."
      },
      {
        "item": "clubs.settings",
        "explanation": "Settings maps have different keys across documents, so storing them as jsonb keeps all of them without forcing a fixed column list. Queries on individual keys will be less strict than normal columns."
      },
      {
